 ],
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "You're looking at a highway.",
   "startFrame": 10,
   "endFrame": 41
  },
  {
   "text": "Seriously.",
   "startFrame": 42,
   "endFrame": 61
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty years ago this exact spot",
   "startFrame": 62,
   "endFrame": 108
  },
  {
   "text": "was six lanes of elevated motorway,",
   "startFrame": 109,
   "endFrame": 163
  },
  {
   "text": "up on concrete stilts,",
   "startFrame": 164,
   "endFrame": 199
  },
  {
   "text": "roaring straight over the middle of Seoul.",
   "startFrame": 200,
   "endFrame": 262
  },
  {
   "text": "And underneath it,",
   "startFrame": 271,
   "endFrame": 289
  },
  {
   "text": "sealed under a concrete lid,",
   "startFrame": 290,
   "endFrame": 328
  },
  {
   "text": "there was a stream.",
   "startFrame": 329,
   "endFrame": 371
  },
  {
   "text": "Seoul buried this water back in the fifties.",
   "startFrame": 372,
   "endFrame": 429
  },
  {
   "text": "It smelled, the city was broke,",
   "startFrame": 430,
   "endFrame": 470
  },
  {
   "text": "and paving over it was the cheap answer.",
   "startFrame": 471,
   "endFrame": 532
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they built the freeway on top",
   "startFrame": 533,
   "endFrame": 573
  },
  {
   "text": "and for thirty years,",
   "startFrame": 574,
   "endFrame": 601
  },
  {
   "text": "that was just what this place was.",
   "startFrame": 602,
   "endFrame": 651
  },
  {
   "text": "Until two thousand three,",
   "startFrame": 653,
   "endFrame": 686
  },
  {
   "text": "when the city did the thing",
   "startFrame": 687,
   "endFrame": 714
  },
  {
   "text": "that basically nobody does.",
   "startFrame": 715,
   "endFrame": 761
  },
  {
   "text": "They tore the freeway down.",
   "startFrame": 762,
   "endFrame": 800
  },
  {
   "text": "Five point eight kilometres.",
   "startFrame": 801,
   "endFrame": 841
  },
  {
   "text": "Two years.",
   "startFrame": 842,
   "endFrame": 873
  },
  {
   "text": "Three hundred and eighty six billion won.",
   "startFrame": 874,
   "endFrame": 921
  },
  {
   "text": "They pulled the lid off",
   "startFrame": 922,
   "endFrame": 943
  },
  {
   "text": "and let the water back out.",
   "startFrame": 944,
   "endFrame": 987
  },
  {
   "text": "The mayor who pushed it through",
   "startFrame": 998,
   "endFrame": 1025
  },
  {
   "text": "was president two years later.",
   "startFrame": 1026,
   "endFrame": 1074
  },
  {
   "text": "And the city says it runs about three degrees",
   "startFrame": 1075,
   "endFrame": 1126
  },
  {
   "text": "cooler down here than the street up there.",
   "startFrame": 1127,
   "endFrame": 1177
  },
  {
   "text": "So that breeze isn't landscaping.",
   "startFrame": 1178,
   "endFrame": 1226
  },
  {
   "text": "That's a road that isn't there any more.",
   "startFrame": 1227,
   "endFrame": 1283
  },
  {
   "text": "Seoul is full of places",
   "startFrame": 1293,
   "endFrame": 1325
  },
  {
   "text": "that used to be something else.",
   "startFrame": 1326,
   "endFrame": 1369
  },
  {
   "text": "We wrote them all up at epickor dot com.",
   "startFrame": 1370,
   "endFrame": 1431
  }
 ]
